    {
      "id": "61c535e0-e299-41ae-90e5-3c478c832d74",
      "name": "Note: in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 1 Case in, rules (code)\nThe kit runner POSTs one case here: `{case_id, today, input, output_schema}`.\nFile texts are already in `input` (e.g. `input.email`).\n**Load rules** reads the owner's rules (`data/*.md`) with the kit tool `rules_get`.\nTest it: run an eval in the kit UI."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d44d2136-340b-453e-b6d7-cec4ae782954",
      "name": "Note: triage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        380,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 340,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 2 Triage (AI step)\nOne model call: category, flags, sender address.\nPrompt: node **Triage** > Chat Messages > **Message**.\nThe fields: sub-node **Triage fields**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4395d5bb-418d-4f69-846e-46979f78f0ac",
      "name": "Note: gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 280,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 3 Junk? (code)\n**Code decides the path.** Spam, newsletter, phishing or off_target: no reply, no more model calls (**Result: no reply**).\nChange the rule in the IF node."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4d12d1b3-6eda-4d77-9ede-91e5c0837811",
      "name": "Note: context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 4 Context (tools, no AI)\nPlain HTTP calls to the kit tools (`POST .../mcp/call/<tool>`, body = the arguments):\n**Find sender** = `contacts_lookup`, **Earlier emails** = `inbox_history` (before today).\nMore context: copy a node, change the tool name and the body."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b40fc254-72c8-4ae1-9575-d43b5b28e91a",
      "name": "Note: draft",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1480,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 380,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 5 Decide and draft (AI step)\n**The main prompt is here**: node **Decide and draft** > Chat Messages > **Message** (the steps). Change one thing, Publish, run the eval again.\n**Result shape** forces the schema of the case (`output.schema.json`): a schema change needs no edit here."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ec110609-718f-4dd2-913d-98a39952ec9e",
      "name": "Note: out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        -640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 360,
        "content": "## 6 Result out\nAnswers the runner with the result JSON.\nAfter an edit: **Publish** (top right). The eval runs only the published version. Then `make n8n-export`."
      }
    }
